window.products.push({"id":415234,"name":"KYERLISH Digital Coffee Scale with Timer, Auto Timing Espresso Scale Rechargeable Drip Scale Auto Off Pour Over Scale with Timer, 2kg/0.1g","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/6131UP-WWYS._SL1500_.jpg","description":"[Precise & Stable Measurement] KYERLISH coffee scale is adopted with latest weighing parts and program, to help you create a tasty cup of coffee with fast readout time and high accuracy class. Non-slip pads and removable silicone cover also provide stable weighing condition. Measurement range: 1g – 2000g, 0.1g intervals. Error value within ±0.3g is normal of every 1000g weight. [4 Modes Switchable with Auto Timing] Comes with 4 built-in weighing modes: PR1 full-automatic mode, PR2 manual mode, PR3 semi-automatic mode, PR4 ratio mode. Take mode PR3 as an example, put our coffee scale on the espresso machine tray, turn to mode PR3, put espresso shots on the scale, the weight data is shown and will be cleared automatically; and timer will start automatically when the first drop of espresso drips on. [Compact Size for Espresso Weighing] Designed with 6x5.5x0.75 inch size and item weight is only 319g/11.8oz, this compact espresso scale is suitable for most espresso machine, which is also portable and lightweight, perfect for daily home/commercial/travel/office coffee making. [Type-C USB Charging & Auto-off] Powered by 1000mAh lithium battery with type-C USB charging, the use time is up to 15hours. Automatically shuts off when not in use, you can switch the auto-off time by long pressing MODE button between 30/60/120/180/240/300 seconds. [Multi-function Coffee & Kitchen Scale] Serve as not only a pour over coffee scale, but also as a digital kitchen scale. LCD screen with touch button, built-in timer, tare function, unit switchable from g-oz-ml. Get one KYERLISH coffee/kitchen scale and it will solve both the needs of your daily coffee & cooking weighing. 1-year worriless warranty is offered.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/6131UP-WWYS._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kyerlish","source_asin":"B0923DMDWH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-415234","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0923DMDWH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0923DMDWH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
