window.products.push({"id":415317,"name":"REOKA Cervical Pillow for Neck Pain Relief (Firm) Memory Foam Pillows for Neck Support, Front, Back, Stomach and Side Sleeper Pillow, Shoulder Sleepin","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":34.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81rUH8UemQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Reduce Neck & Back Pain : The number one reason for neck & back pain is a lack of support and misalignment of the spine. The Reoka cervical support pillow, introduces a gradual slope that cradles the neck from the base of the spine all the way to your head. This slope keeps your neck from being pinched due to lack of support as well as keeping your back more aligned. Sleep Comfortably in Any Position : The unique shape of the pillow accommodates a whole range of different sleeping styles. As a back sleeper pillow, the base of the neck is cradled gently. As a side sleeping pillow, the same slope makes room for your shoulder and keeps your spine straight. As a stomach sleeping pillow, the raised shape makes it easier to breathe and put your arms around Memory Foam Support : Shaped out of premium, high-density memory foam, makes our ergonomic pillows softly support your head without sinking all the way down. Made using natural processes, this eco-friendly pillow will last for years with each day as supportive as the first day you tried it Cool & Therapeutic Pillow : Our patented cooling pillowcase is super soft and breathable. It easily transfers your body heat throughout the pillow over night to keep the surface nice and cool. The pillow case is removable for easy washing and drying. During washing infuse with therapeutic aroma essences for an unforgettable nights sleep! Satisfaction Guaranteed or Your Money Back : We stand behind the fact that you will love our product and that it will change how you sleep for the rest of your life. If you think that it doesn't meet our high expectations, then you can contact us for a hassle free refund! You sleep for almost a third of every day, you should only settle for the best pillow around, the Reoka Cervical Pillow!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81rUH8UemQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"REOKA","source_asin":"B0C63QKLM1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-415317","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C63QKLM1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C63QKLM1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
