window.products.push({"id":415332,"name":"Big Bachelorette Party Decorations KIT. Perfect for Bridal Shower. Lots of Rose Gold Balloons, Impressive Bride to Be Glitter Banners, Sash, Tattoos, ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31YdQPt0AnL._AC_.jpg","description":"A lot of thought was put into creating this unique kit which contains lots of accessories and essentials You won’t find this kit anywhere on the Internet! It also comes in a sturdy white card board box, not a cheap poly bag Spoil her with a luxurious, one of a kind, (35*2= 70 inches), satin finish “Bride to Be” SASH This sash has 2 layers with glitter-font and is open style to easily fit any size girl It comes with decorative two-sided, pearl/gold pin for easy closing Make her feel special! The VEIL is made from soft tulle, extra-long (30 inches), unique, elegant and has satin edges Unlike the other kits that you see online, this veil comes with a custom size LARGE comb (4 inches wide) for a secure fit and has the words “Bride to Be” beautifully engraved on the back This kit also comes with 22 fun, METALLIC TATTOOS! Two of the tattoos read “Bride” and 20 that read “Bride Tribe”. Pass them out to all of your lovely ladies Get those pictures taken with the perfect background for those memories that will last a lifetime! Hang balloons and banners in the house, outside, on the ceiling or wherever you want PLEASE NOTE, USE HIGH QUALITY OR PURE HELIUM TO FILL YOUR BALLOONS Cheaper, low grade helium is not good enough and your confetti balloons will only float for a few hours HIGH GRADE helium will allow balloons to float much longer Helium from discount stores only allows balloons to float for 2-4 hours Once balloons are filled with helium, shake the confetti filled balloons and rub them on the carpet or your hair to get enough static to make the confetti stick to the sides Go ahead and give it a try! If you’re not satisfied for any reason, Amazon has you covered with their “A-to-z Guarantee”","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31YdQPt0AnL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ingenious Celebrations","source_asin":"B07F8GZ43X","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-415332","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07F8GZ43X","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07F8GZ43X","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
