window.products.push({"id":415460,"name":"Thickened Canning Lids and Rings Set 100pcs,70mm Canning Lids for Ball, Kerr Jars -Leakproof Seal canning jar lids and Reusable bands,Regular Mouth Ma","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81e6ZN4oTwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"💖【Specifications】： 🌸Size: diameter 70mm/2.75inch,suit for regular mouth canning lids,100% Fit for Ball, Kerr Jars 🌸Material: Tinplate Metal with Silicone Sealing Ring 🌸Package: 50pcs Regular Mouth Canning Lids 50 pieces regular canning jar bands, 1* magnetic Lid Lifter 🌸Color:Silver 💖【Customer questions&answers】: ▲Question:👉Will they fit for Kerr jars? Ball jars ? ▼Answer: 👍Yes, they fit all my jars Atlas, Ball, Kerr...Even some of the old jars. Great fit. ▲Question:👉How to make sure the sealing? ▼Answer: 👍Safety buckle on the lid, which you could judge if your canning sealing well. Press down on the center of the lid. Check does it move up and down or does it feel solid and concave Solid and concave means a good seal, movement means no seal. This way to test would help you sealing canning better. ▲Question:👉Why Lids Buckled During Canning? ▼Answer: 👍During canning, air trapped in the head space between the bottom of the lid and the top of the food is forced out of the jar. When lids are too tight, the air cannot easily escape so it forces its way out by deforming the lid. This leads to the buckling or crinkling effect.When you remove your jars from the canner and set them out to cool, steam vapor will continue to be released until the jar begins to cool and the wax ring on the sealing lid suctions into place and creates a permanent seal. General rule of thumb is to tighten your rings “Finger Tight” – meaning use your fingers, not your entire palm to tighten and there should be another ¼ inch of room to continue turning the sealing ring. ▲Question:👉Will these thickened canning lids be deformed? ▼Answer: 👍our canning jar lids is the newest upgraded version ,it is heavier than other's canning lids,these thickened design makes it more solid and high temperature resistant，Compared with other lids, it is less prone to deformation.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81e6ZN4oTwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HOMMES","source_asin":"B097JNXTGT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-415460","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B097JNXTGT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B097JNXTGT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
