window.products.push({"id":415483,"name":"Magicozy Dried Pampas Grass 16 inch, Small Natural Dried Pampas for Floral Arrangements, Wedding and Home Décor (White 40 Pcs)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.9,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/712p9KNgR0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Magicozy aims to provide every valued customer with unique and wonderful finds, especially from nature. Our vision is to make your life magic and cozy . Magicozy always insists on highest standards over the design, product quality and customer services. This product is Magicozy Dried Pampas Grass 16 inch, Small Natural Dried Pampas for Floral Arrangements, Wedding and Home Décor (White 40 Pcs). Pampas Grass Info: This is a guide on how to get the best out of your Pampas plant! STEP 1 Shake After receiving the pampas, please open it outside. Give each reed a mild shake to allow excess plume shedding to occur, which will fluff out the plumes and get them ready for use as decorations in your home. Please put the pampas in the sunlight for 3 hours to get extra fluffy. STEP 2 Spray Spray some hairspray on the pampas lightly and give each plume a generous mist. This will help minimize shedding. Spraying every 6 months ensures that the pampas will stay nice. STEP 3 Savor Trim the pampas grass to a desired height. Pluck any extra plume you don't like and then arrange it in your vase. STEP 4 Care Please keep it dry. Some light shedding is normal and will not change the look of the plumes. Well-cared-for pampas grass can last up to three years. Note: If the pampas has been damaged during shipment, or if anything is missing or incorrect, please contact us for help.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/712p9KNgR0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Magicozy","source_asin":"B09H7LZ5Y5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-415483","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09H7LZ5Y5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09H7LZ5Y5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
