window.products.push({"id":415574,"name":"Trademark Fine Art IC01563-C2432GG Sandpipers by Brooke T. Ryan, 24x32, Multiple","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":59.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71zHLT+uZrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This ready to hang, gallery-wrapped art piece features birds sitting on an empty beach. Comprising the work of some of the worlds finest contemporary artists and photographers, our line of Modern Publications offer a curated selection of high quality, original images that can greatly enhance your product line or projects. For the retailer, our combination of contemporary fine art imagery mixed with our extensive selection of fun novelty images and top selling posters, makes for an irresistible product mix. Giclee (jee-clay) is an advanced printmaking process for creating high quality fine art reproductions. The attainable excellence that Giclee printmaking affords makes the reproduction virtually indistinguishable from the original piece. The result is wide acceptance of Giclee by galleries, museums, and private collectors. Gallery wrap is a method of stretching an artist's canvas so that the canvas wraps around the sides and is secured a hidden, wooden frame. This method of stretching and preparing a canvas allows for a frameless presentation of the finished painting.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71zHLT+uZrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trademark Fine Art","source_asin":"B07R69D986","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-415574","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07R69D986","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07R69D986","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":415575,"name":"Unbleached Parchment Paper for Baking, 15 in x 210 ft, 260 Sq.Ft, Heavy Duty Baking Paper with Slide Cutter, Non-stick Brown Parchment Paper Roll for ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71V7guZelsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"EASY TO TEAR WITH SLIDE CUTTER - Baking parchment paper roll is 15 in W and 210 ft L. This baking paper can be cut into any length with a perfectly smooth edge with parchment paper dispenser with cutter, which is designed to prevent people from cutting hands and easy to meet your different baking needs. NATURAL & HEALTHY - This 15inch unbleached parchment paper is made from 100% natural wood pulp. Food grade silicone coated is safe and non-toxic, fluorescence free. Are you interested in baking but hate cleaning? This heavy duty parchment paper for baking can reduce the trouble of cleaning and enjoy a happy baking time. HEAVY DUTY & EXTRA STRONG - Made of extra thicker 45gsm paper vs commonly used 35gsm or 40gsm paper, it's about 12% thicker. We define it as heavy duty parchment paper. You will find that our paper is more thicker and stronger than normal wax paper roll. You can touch it by hand or measure it with a kitchen scale. It is excellent value for money. Thick enough to pick up cooked loaf of bread without disintegrating. Great for home bakers, cake makers, and pastry tasters. NON-STICK & EASY TO CLEAN - Are you worried that the baked food will stick to the paper? This heavy duty baking paper coated with food-grade silicone oil on both sides, which will not bring other flavors to the food when baking and it can also prevent the food from sticking to the baking tray, non stick paper liners make the pan easy to clean. MULTI-USE & OVEN SAFE - This parchment paper for cooking can withstand a temperature of 425° F, which is much higher than the requirements of most recipes, You can see it in most people's kitchens. The baking parchment paper roll can be used in heat press, cake pan liners, freezer, microwave, oven baking, grilling or air fryer anywhere you can think of. Cooking paper can be used to bake cakes, biscuits, bread, meat, desserts, pizza, etc.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71V7guZelsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"katbite","source_asin":"B09KM1TZKL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-415575","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09KM1TZKL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09KM1TZKL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
