window.products.push({"id":415611,"name":"Home-X Pizza Slice Container with Attached Lid, Plastic Micro Pizza Box for Leftovers","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":8.7,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81QL0l-1aiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Tired of leaving leftover pizza in the box only to be disappointed by stale crust? Or how about trying to make room for an entire pizza delivery box in your refrigerator? We have the solution! Our plastic container is built to store pizza and keep it fresh, so you don’t have to worry about your leftover slices. This white Micro Pizza Box is perfectly sized and shaped like a triangle to store a large slice of pizza. Just place the slice in the container and close the lid. The food saver will seal in freshness and lock in flavor. Our box can go from the fridge to the microwave, so you don’t have to get out other dishes to heat up your pizza when you get hungry. We designed our box to be microwave and dishwasher safe. So go ahead and use this box like a pizza warmer so you can savor your pizza long after it has come out of the oven. It’s great for adults and kids too! The small size of this container makes it easy to take to school or work because it doesn’t take up too much space. And you don’t need to take extra plates or utensils—we offer an all-in-one solution to enjoying an American classic. The best part of this container is that it is eco-friendly. A lot of pizza boxes on the market are flimsy and disposable. But not this one! Our reusable plastic box is ready to store your favorite pizza slices for years to come. We know that you will enjoy this pizza box and so will the pizza lovers in your life. Give this box to your pizza-loving friends for their birthday, for Christmas, or for any other special occasion.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81QL0l-1aiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Home-X","source_asin":"B07L5TBG9G","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-415611","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07L5TBG9G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07L5TBG9G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
