window.products.push({"id":415828,"name":"Candleberry White Woods Cabin, Fine Fragrance Candle for The Home, Large Glass Jar, 26 OZ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Z7rEBak4L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Imagine a cabin in the woods just as winter approaches. While snow begins to pile, scents you cannot quite imagine gently fill the air. Are they the smells of logs, or of the leaves just departed from their trees, or is it a combination of coconut, bergamot, musk, cinnamon and lily of the valley? Do you detect musk and sandalwood, vanilla, cedar and more? Did you dream them all together or is this remarkable candle the cause of it all?. The Candleberry Company — Remarkably Reminiscent — these fantastic fragrances are inspired by the family traditions and memories that we all hold dear from special recipes, scents that filled our homes during the holidays, reflections, emotions, and so much more. The production process is fine-tuned to create candles that burn cleanly and are heavily scented from first light to the end of the burn. This high quality glass jar is reusable after the candle has burned through, making it a wonderful and elegant gift perfect for any occasion, it's like two gifts in one! — use as a small cookie jar to store delicious treats, for delectable desserts and other mason jar style recipes, as a school or office supply holder, for small potted plants or flower arrangements, arts and crafts for decoration, the possibilities are endless!. Capacity of 26 ounces offers a long lasting fabulous fragrance with approximately 140 to 160 hours of burn time — Measures approximately 5 ½\" Height x 4\" Diameter.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Z7rEBak4L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"The Candleberry Co.","source_asin":"B07HJDN9TH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-415828","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07HJDN9TH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07HJDN9TH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":415829,"name":"National Tree Company Pre-Lit 'Feel Real' Artificial Full Christmas Tree, Green, Northern Frasier Fir, White Lights, Includes Stand, 7.5 Feet","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":349.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81DK8nJbYfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Transform your home into a winter wonderland with National Tree Company's Pre-Lit ‘Feel Real’ Artificial Christmas Tree. This majestic Northern Frasier Fir tree is 6 feet tall and 56 inches in diameter at the bottom, giving the tree a wide profile. Friends and family alike will marvel at how the tree closely mimics those outside. Molded from real tree branches for an authentic living tree appearance, this tree features our trademarked ‘Feel Real’ technology. Hundreds of crush-resistant polyethylene tips form full bodied branches, creating a tree with remarkable realism. The tree is designed with a hinged branch system that allows the branches to swing down for a quick and simple set-up and fold back in for easy storage. Set aside 45-60 minutes after assembly to properly shape the tree by peeling back the branches and pulling the tips apart to give the branches a more full-bodied look. This fantastically festive tree is strung with 800 white UL lights prior to packaging and includes a sturdy, metal base for a more convenient setup. The lights operate individually, so if the bulb lens has not been cracked or broken, the light set will continue to illuminate except for any individual bulbs that are not working. Before dressing the tree in twinkling lights and glistening ornaments, consider placing it in a living room or dining area where it can be viewed from multiple angles and does not block any entryways. Constructed with sturdy, high quality materials and hypo-allergenic, fire-resistant needles, this tree is built to bring holiday cheer for years to come. At National Tree Company, we strive to create high quality Christmas decorations to help you transform your home so you can keep making every holiday moment magical.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81DK8nJbYfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"National Tree Company","source_asin":"B098XNTVXF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-415829","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B098XNTVXF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B098XNTVXF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
