window.products.push({"id":415835,"name":"INSE Corded Vacuum Cleaner, 600W Powerful Motor 18000Pa Vacuum Cleaner, 6-in-1 Versatile Corded Stick Vacuum Cleaner - Blue","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":199.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61EwJthH-aL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【600W POWERFUL MOTOR】INSE corded stick vacuum is equipped with a 600W strong motor, can generate up to 18000Pa powerful suction, is perfect for hardwood floors, marble floors, tile, low pile carpet, and can easily pick up all kinds of particles like dust, pet hair, pet litter, cereal, etc. 【6-in-1 MULTIFUNCTION】The vacuum cleaner is easy to assemble and has 3 different attachment heads - main floor brush & crevice tool & 2-in-1 brush, which can have 6 versatile combinations. When converted from a stick vacuum cleaner to a handheld vacuum cleaner, it performs decently on corners, stairs, shelves, and even on your car. 【HIGH-EFFICIENT FILTRATION】The vacuum cleaner filters and captures up to 99.99% of microparticles and expels cleaner air, providing a clean and healthy home for your family. An extra filter is provided as a backup, regularly cleaning or replacing the filter can maintain the powerful suction. (Please make sure to use the vacuum cleaner with the filter.) 【EASY TO USE】This vacuum allows 23ft of long-distance cleaning, no need to worry about running out of power. The lightweight vacuum cleaner tube can be adjusted from 19 to 31 inches, suitable for all family members. One-click can start the vacuum, and one press can empty the 1L dust cup. The filter is washable and reusable, please leave it dry before refitting. 【CONVENIENT DESIGN】The main floor brush reduces the tangled issue of hair with no beater roller design. The vacuum cleaner corded comes with a tiny storage hook that can be attached to the tube to store accessories, very space-saving and convenient. Each INSE vacuum cleaner is well-made and we back it with a 12-month warranty and professional customer support, please buy with confidence.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61EwJthH-aL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"INSE","source_asin":"B0C6CZKJ86","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-415835","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C6CZKJ86","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C6CZKJ86","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
