window.products.push({"id":415895,"name":"Shazo HUGE SET - 54 PCS - Food Storage Containers w/Airtight Lids (21 contianers + 21 Lids) w/6 Mini Containers, Leak Proof Lunch/Bento Box - BPA Free","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":42.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91M19Xbd0WL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"54 Piece Container Set Includes 27 Containers And 27 Lids - allowing you to store and transport your food items with and confidence. The snap-lock feature ensures that your food stays securely contained during transportation, preventing any spills or leaks. These containers are not only great for storing & transporting entrees and soups, but also for small arts and crafts supplies such as beads. With this set, you'll have all the containers you need for your food storage & transportation needs. BPA Free, Airtight, Leak Proof, Odor Proof, Stain Resistant - BPA-free materials, ensuring that the containers are safe for food storage and free from any harmful chemicals. Additionally, the containers are odor-proof and stain-resistant, so you don't have to worry about any unpleasant odors or unsightly stains affecting your food. Shazo 54 piece container set is a great solution to store and transport food items. Dishwasher, Microwave, Freezer, And Fridge Safe - The 4-hinge locking system creates an airtight and watertight seal between the container and the lid, preventing any spills or leaks. The translucent design of the containers allows for easy identification of contents. Conveniently reheat food directly in the container (after removing the lid). Packing a lunch for work or school, storing leftovers, or preparing food in advance, these containers are a practical solution for all your food storage. 54 Piece Container Set Includes Multiple Sizes To Meet All Your Storage Needs - The set includes 7 35 oz rectangular containers, 7 30 oz rectangular containers, 7 25 oz round containers, and 6 0.33 oz round containers. This variety of sizes provides options for storing all types of food items, from large entrees and casseroles to small snacks and dips. And when it's time to clean up, both the lids and containers can be easily popped into the dishwasher for convenient and hassle-free cleaning. The Secure Sealing And Stackable Design Of These Containers - make them a great choice for anyone looking to store food in a fresh and organized manner. The flap on the lid locks into place, and the silicone seal inside the lid expands to create an airtight seal, keeping food fresher for longer. The stackable and modular design of the containers saves valuable space in your refrigerators, pantry, and cabinets, allowing for better kitchen organization. The Portion Sizing Design Of These Containers - is a great feature for anyone looking to keep their food and other items organized and protected. The 54 piece set includes 27 containers with 27 lids, making it easy to store and transport different types of food and other items. The set is also great for kitchen and pantry organization and storage. Whether you're at home or on the go, this 44 Piece plastic Container Set is a versatile and practical solution. Shazo Food Containers Are Designed To Help The User Save Money by allowing them to store leftovers and pack meals for on-the-go. The containers are made to be sturdy and reusable, reducing the need for disposable packaging and minimizing waste. The innovative 4-hinge snap-lock system making it a convenient and cost-effective solution for packing lunch or storing leftovers. By doing so, the user can avoid buying fast food or processed lunch kits, saving money in the long run. Shazo Food Containers Are A Must-have - for anyone who wants to keep their food fresh and secure. Made from strong and solid polypropylene (PP) plastic material, these containers are built to last and can withstand regular usage even in rough conditions. The containers are 100% BPA-free, making them a safe and healthy option for food storage. Whether you're packing leftovers for work or school, or storing ingredients in the pantry, these containers will help keep your food fresh and protected. The Versatility And Long-lasting Design Of These Containers - make them a great investment for anyone who wants to keep their food and other items organized and protected. The fact that they are refrigerator, freezer, and microwave safe (base only, not lid, under 5 min and under 700 Watt, for at least half-full containers) makes them an ideal choice for anyone who wants to heat or cool their food quickly and easily. And the stain-resistant and dishwasher safe design. Shazo Food Containers Are An Excellent Solution - for anyone who wants to keep their food fresh and secure. With their strong and durable construction, BPA-free material, and innovative design, these containers are a great investment for anyone looking for a reliable and cost-effective solution for food storage.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91M19Xbd0WL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Shazo","source_asin":"B08RWMY1MW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-415895","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08RWMY1MW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08RWMY1MW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
